    "annotations": [
        {
            "id": "ann_1",
            "type": "note",
            "text": "Full Pipeline \u2014 Fluid VOL Driving POP Particles\n\nThis patch combines fluid simulation with particle advection:\n\n  VOL chain (bottom): NoiseVOL \u2192 FluidVOL \u2192 RaymarchVOL\n    Creates animated fluid density with Navier-Stokes solver.\n\n  POP chain (top): SourcePOP \u2192 AdvectPOP(+FluidVOL) \u2192 Turbulence \u2192 Limit \u2192 Render\n    Particles are advected by the same fluid velocity field,\n    creating a unified smoke + particle system.\n\nBoth windows show the same simulation from the VOL and POP\nperspectives \u2014 the particles track the fluid motion.",
            "position": [
                -100.0,
                -130.0
